    "title": "Hill City Howlers walk off Fredericksburg on RBI single, 4-3 - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Dave Walls ,\n1 days ago LYNCHBURG, Va. (WDBJ) - The Hill City Howlers walked-off the Fredericksburg Nationals on Tuesday evening, 4-3, behind a Dauri Fernandez RBI-single. With the walk-off, Fernandez extended his RBI-streak to six games. He also currently rides an eight game hit streak. The Nationals struck first after back-to-back singles to open up... Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
